{"id":"a50ebde4b7b3e426","group":"89","path":"89/89-df-realization-function.md","title":"Realization Function","display":"df-realization-function — Realization Function","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"The Logic of Provability","book_abbrev":"89","label":"89-df-realization-function","aliases":["89-df-realization-function"],"display":"df-realization-function — Realization Function","depends_on":["[[89-df-modal-formula]]","[[89-df-arithmetical-language]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"The Logic of Provability"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"89"},{"key":"label","html":"89-df-realization-function"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>89-df-realization-function</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-realization-function — Realization Function"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"56c1b5b75a32ca1d\" href=\"?note=56c1b5b75a32ca1d\" title=\"89-df-modal-formula\">89-df-modal-formula</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"a257e5b1de6880b7\" href=\"?note=a257e5b1de6880b7\" title=\"89-df-arithmetical-language\">89-df-arithmetical-language</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Prop}\">\\(\\mathrm{Prop}\\)</span> is the set of propositional variables.</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"T\\subseteq\\mathrm{Sent}_{T}\">\\(T\\subseteq\\mathrm{Sent}_{T}\\)</span> is an arithmetical theory.</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}realization\\text{-}function}\\vdash\n\\mathcal{R}_{T}\n\\coloneqq\n\\mathrm{Sent}_{T}^{\\mathrm{Prop}}\n=\\{r\\mid r:\\mathrm{Prop}\\to\\mathrm{Sent}_{T}\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}realization\\text{-}function}\\vdash\n\\mathcal{R}_{T}\n\\coloneqq\n\\mathrm{Sent}_{T}^{\\mathrm{Prop}}\n=\\{r\\mid r:\\mathrm{Prop}\\to\\mathrm{Sent}_{T}\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>关键符号：</p>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"r\\in\\mathcal{R}_{T}\">\\(r\\in\\mathcal{R}_{T}\\)</span> assigns an arithmetical sentence to each propositional variable.</li>\n<li>The structural extension of <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"r\">\\(r\\)</span> is defined separately in <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"55612987d4585fa4\" href=\"?note=55612987d4585fa4\" title=\"89-df-arithmetical-interpretation\">89-df-arithmetical-interpretation</a>.</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"89-df-modal-formula","status":"resolved","id":"56c1b5b75a32ca1d","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[89-df-modal-formula]]","embed":false},{"target":"89-df-arithmetical-language","status":"resolved","id":"a257e5b1de6880b7","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[89-df-arithmetical-language]]","embed":false},{"target":"89-df-arithmetical-interpretation","status":"resolved","id":"55612987d4585fa4","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Remark]","excerpt":"The structural extension of $r$ is defined separately in [[89-df-arithmetical-interpretation]].","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"\\mathrm{Prop}","display":false},{"tex":"T\\subseteq\\mathrm{Sent}_{T}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}realization\\text{-}function}\\vdash\n\\mathcal{R}_{T}\n\\coloneqq\n\\mathrm{Sent}_{T}^{\\mathrm{Prop}}\n=\\{r\\mid r:\\mathrm{Prop}\\to\\mathrm{Sent}_{T}\\}.","display":true},{"tex":"r\\in\\mathcal{R}_{T}","display":false},{"tex":"r","display":false}],"bytes":876,"backlinks":[{"id":"55612987d4585fa4","anchor":"ref-7","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$r\\in\\mathcal{R}_{T}\\subseteq\n\\mathrm{Sent}_{T}^{\\mathrm{Prop}}$ (see\n[[89-df-realization-function]])."},{"id":"1f581262c09d5e34","anchor":"ref-3","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\mathcal{R}_{T}\\subseteq\\mathrm{Sent}_{T}^{\\mathrm{Prop}}$ is the\nset of realization functions from [[89-df-realization-function]]."},{"id":"ea390338eae06fff","anchor":"ref-3","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\mathcal R_T$ and $\\tau_{T,r}$ are fixed by\n[[89-df-realization-function]] and\n[[89-df-arithmetical-interpretation]]."},{"id":"19a5fceb5d504d9f","anchor":"ref-1","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""},{"id":"e0c421a5b45aeb77","anchor":"ref-401","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[89-df-realization-function]]"}],"outgoing":["56c1b5b75a32ca1d","a257e5b1de6880b7","55612987d4585fa4"]}